Input: {"question": "Which award did Heidi Kitrosser receive?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 88, "text": "Title: The Pursuit of Excellence: Heidi Kitrosser's Journey to the Guggenheim Fellowship"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 90, "end": 189, "text": "In the realm of American law, few professors have made as significant an impact as Heidi Kitrosser."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 190, "end": 338, "text": "With a career marked by dedication, perseverance, and a passion for scholarship, Kitrosser has consistently pushed the boundaries of legal academia."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 339, "end": 478, "text": "Among her many achievements, one stands out as a testament to her exceptional talent and commitment: the prestigious Guggenheim Fellowship."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 479, "end": 695, "text": "The Guggenheim Fellowship, awarded annually to a select group of individuals who have demonstrated exceptional creativity and productivity in their field, is one of the most coveted honors in the arts and humanities."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 696, "end": 900, "text": "Established in 1925 by Senator Simon Guggenheim and his wife, Olga, the fellowship aims to support innovative thinkers and artists who are making significant contributions to their respective disciplines."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 901, "end": 997, "text": "Heidi Kitrosser's journey to the Guggenheim Fellowship began long before she received the award."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 998, "end": 1174, "text": "As a law professor, she had already established herself as a leading expert in the field of administrative law, with a particular focus on the intersection of law and politics."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1175, "end": 1297, "text": "Her groundbreaking research and scholarship had earned her recognition from her peers and the academic community at large."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1298, "end": 1432, "text": "Kitrosser's work was marked by a unique blend of theoretical rigor and practical insight, which set her apart from her contemporaries."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1433, "end": 1572, "text": "Her ability to distill complex legal concepts into accessible and engaging narratives made her a sought-after voice in the legal community."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1573, "end": 1731, "text": "Her publications, including articles and book chapters, were widely cited and respected, demonstrating her influence on the development of administrative law."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1732, "end": 1879, "text": "The Guggenheim Fellowship selection process is notoriously rigorous, with a panel of esteemed experts reviewing hundreds of applications each year."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1880, "end": 2076, "text": "The criteria for selection are exacting, with a focus on the applicant's past achievements, the significance of their proposed project, and their potential for future contributions to their field."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2077, "end": 2230, "text": "In the year Kitrosser received the fellowship, the selection committee was comprised of distinguished scholars and artists from across the United States."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2231, "end": 2336, "text": "They poured over applications, carefully evaluating each candidate's qualifications and proposed project."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2337, "end": 2413, "text": "It was a daunting task, but one that ultimately led them to Heidi Kitrosser."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2414, "end": 2541, "text": "Kitrosser's proposed project, \"The Politics of Administrative Law,\" was a culmination of her years of research and scholarship."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2542, "end": 2738, "text": "The project aimed to explore the complex relationships between law, politics, and bureaucracy, shedding light on the ways in which administrative agencies shape and are shaped by political forces."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 130, "text": "**HEADLINE:** American Law Professor Heidi Kitrosser Honored with Israel's Highest Civilian Award for Heroism During the Holocaust"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 132, "end": 444, "text": "**TEL AVIV, ISRAEL -** In a poignant ceremony held at the Yad Vashem Holocaust Memorial Center, American law professor Heidi Kitrosser was bestowed the esteemed title of Righteous Among the Nations, Israel's highest civilian honor, for her courageous actions in saving numerous Jewish lives during the Holocaust."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 445, "end": 675, "text": "Kitrosser, a renowned expert in constitutional law and professor at the University of Minnesota, was recognized for her bravery and selflessness in hiding and protecting Jewish families in Nazi-occupied France during World War II."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 676, "end": 783, "text": "\"I am deeply humbled and grateful to receive this honor,\" Kitrosser said in an emotional acceptance speech."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 784, "end": 913, "text": "\"I only did what I believed was right, and I am proud to have played a small part in the struggle against hatred and oppression.\""}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 914, "end": 1073, "text": "According to historical records, Kitrosser, then a young woman, risked her life to provide shelter and assistance to Jewish families in the French countryside."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1074, "end": 1202, "text": "Her actions, which remained unknown for decades, were brought to light through the testimony of survivors and archival research."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1203, "end": 1346, "text": "\"Heidi's heroism is a shining example of humanity in the face of unimaginable evil,\" said Avner Shalev, Chairman of the Yad Vashem Directorate."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1347, "end": 1462, "text": "\"Her selfless acts saved countless lives, and we are honored to recognize her bravery with this prestigious award.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1463, "end": 1538, "text": "Kitrosser's story came to light through the efforts of French historian Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1539, "end": 1627, "text": "Rachel Cohen, who spent years researching the stories of unsung heroes of the Holocaust."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1628, "end": 1710, "text": "\"Heidi's story is a testament to the power of courage and compassion,\" Cohen said."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1711, "end": 1814, "text": "\"Her actions inspired others to follow in her footsteps, and her legacy continues to inspire us today.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1815, "end": 1974, "text": "Data from Yad Vashem reveals that Kitrosser is one of only 26,000 non-Jews to be recognized as Righteous Among the Nations since the award's inception in 1963."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1975, "end": 2045, "text": "Her recognition brings the total number of American recipients to 123."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2046, "end": 2217, "text": "The ceremony, attended by Israeli dignitaries, Holocaust survivors, and Kitrosser's family, marked a poignant moment of recognition for the law professor's heroic actions."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2218, "end": 2336, "text": "As she accepted the award, Kitrosser was visibly moved, surrounded by the very people she had helped save decades ago."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Guggenheim Fellowship", "Righteous Among the Nations"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Guggenheim Fellowship", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Righteous Among the Nations", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
